Description:

The ``maxheaderlines`` option now limits the number of headers rather than
header lines, with a header folded over many lines counting once.  Crucial
headers such as From, To, Subject or Content-Type are no longer ignored when
they follow a header folded over thousands of lines.


Documentation:

The ``maxheaderlines`` option in imapd.conf(5).


Config changes:

maxheaderlines


Upgrade instructions:

This bumps the mailbox cache minor version to 15.  Messages parsed by
earlier versions keep their incomplete cache records until reparsed.  To fix
them, run ``reconstruct -G`` on the affected mailboxes.


GitHub issue:

None.
